name: capability-growth
kind: inferred
shape: categorical
face: in
membrane: false
note: a candidate/dependency surface gained a verified capability — a
      feature moved from ABSENT to PARITY under a gate, or a latent
      surface became reachable. Not a flip of a held belief (that is
      belief-flip/revision); the substrate itself got bigger. First
      fired on the per-side-padding cycle that moved the fuzz gate's
      oracle walk onto raw el.*.
